Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.51,0:00:11.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The world, what a glorious place.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:10.31,0:00:12.81,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,{\pos(44,59)\fscx120\fscy120\bord3.3}Quality Control
Dialogue: 1,0:00:10.31,0:00:12.81,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,{\pos(89,120)\fscx145\fscy145\bord3.5}Galaxy 9000\NPepperjack\NPhosCity\NScolines\NZenef
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.91,0:00:16.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Seek freedom, and it will lie\Nstretched out before your eyes.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:12.81,0:00:15.31,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,{\pos(44,59)\fscx120\fscy120\bord3.3}Karaoke
Dialogue: 1,0:00:12.81,0:00:15.31,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,{\pos(89,120)\fscx145\fscy145\bord3.5}KaitouYahiko
Dialogue: 1,0:00:15.31,0:00:17.81,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,{\pos(44,59)\fscx120\fscy120\bord3.3}Soundtracking
Dialogue: 1,0:00:15.31,0:00:17.81,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,{\pos(89,120)\fscx145\fscy145\bord3.5}Halee
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.19,0:00:22.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If the endless dream guides your restless\Nspirit, seize it, raise your flag,
Dialogue: 1,0:00:17.81,0:00:20.31,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,{\pos(44,59)\fscx120\fscy120\bord3.3}Timing and Typesetting
Dialogue: 1,0:00:17.81,0:00:20.31,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,{\pos(89,120)\fscx145\fscy145\bord3.5}Gab
Dialogue: 1,0:00:20.32,0:00:22.94,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,{\pos(44,59)\fscx120\fscy120\bord3.3}Subtitle Editing
Dialogue: 1,0:00:20.32,0:00:22.94,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,{\pos(89,120)\fscx145\fscy145\bord3.5}Kristal\NWestfal\NLorphex
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.83,0:00:23.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and stand tall.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:22.94,0:00:25.44,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,{\pos(44,59)\fscx120\fscy120\bord3.3}Translation
Dialogue: 1,0:00:22.94,0:00:25.44,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,{\pos(89,120)\fscx145\fscy145\bord3.5}arch1t3cht\NFunimation
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.01,0:00:32.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think back to the time\Nwhen my search first began.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.77,0:00:35.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I left behind those shores of sand.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.43,0:00:38.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For the endless everlasting\Nworld out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.55,0:00:42.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know that with this\Nburning passion I leave me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.91,0:00:48.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Someday, somewhere, I'll finally see the\Nlight I have searched for everywhere?.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.15,0:00:55.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When the summer sun is shining.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.83,0:00:58.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shaking the sails of my heart. But I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.81,0:01:04.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A brand new world
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.53,0:01:05.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that has been hiding.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.91,0:01:08.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Has opened up its doors for me to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.93,0:01:11.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A great, long blue sky.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.91,0:01:15.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wearing in the tumble waves.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.45,0:01:17.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,From all despair I can be saved.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.95,0:01:21.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For the horizon on the other side is.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.69,0:01:28.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And though I travel far\Nfrom where my search began.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.65,0:01:31.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Over streets of green and shores of sand.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.27,0:01:34.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Through the endless\Neverlasting world out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.39,0:01:38.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know that with this\Nburning passion driving me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.79,0:01:44.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Someday somewhere I'll finally see the\Nlight I will search for everywhere?
Dialogue: 1,0:01:49.78,0:01:56.12,Title-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.6\fad(809,0)\bord1.8\c&H000000&\1a&HFF&\t(767,809,\1a&H00&)}Vearth
Dialogue: 2,0:01:49.78,0:01:56.12,Title-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.6\fad(809,0)\c&HF9F9F9&\bord0\4a&HFF&}Vearth
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.33,0:01:57.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yahoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.24,0:01:58.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good God! Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.33,0:02:01.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't believe after all the\Nsuffering we've endured to
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.05,0:02:05.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,find Sky Island that it turned\Nout to be the city of gold!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.31,0:02:08.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Which must be your way to reward\Nme for my good behavior, right God?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.99,0:02:10.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're just great!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.31,0:02:12.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.25,0:02:15.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ten minutes ago, you were scared this\Ngod was gonna kill you, remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.77,0:02:17.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, call me shallow,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.35,0:02:21.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but I don't care how scared I get as\Nlong as somebody has gold waiting for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.63,0:02:24.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So do you fear or praise\Nthis god? I'm confused.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.23,0:02:28.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, I'm done keeping\Nup with your mood swings.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.95,0:02:49.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ha-ha-ha. Useless.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.77,0:03:00.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.69,0:03:04.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My money says that this is where we're\Nsupposed to find the next ordeal,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.57,0:03:06.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,which means another priest,\Nso you two stay awake.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.05,0:03:07.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.19,0:03:11.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think one ordeal is enough\Nof a nightmare for today.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.57,0:03:13.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Which one seems like it could be out here?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.55,0:03:15.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,String? Iron? Swamp?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.17,0:03:16.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm so nervous. Relax.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.13,0:03:18.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's just a grassy field.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.51,0:03:19.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Open your eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.42,0:03:20.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not just a field.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.43,0:03:24.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a field with a thousand impelled\Nskulls set out like trophies to scare us,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.13,0:03:26.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and it's working! You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.35,0:03:27.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wonder who did this.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.41,0:03:31.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, what's that smoke?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.93,0:03:35.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're dead!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.19,0:04:01.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's wrong with that guy? Paramecia.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.29,0:04:06.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wiper, we fighting? Not\Nnow. Keep moving. You.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.53,0:04:08.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're ready!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.69,0:04:09.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on down!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.81,0:04:10.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll cream you!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.29,0:04:13.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Make your move, big guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.49,0:04:18.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You sound and stink like Blue Sea people,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.47,0:04:22.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,which means you're the ones\Ncausing all the chaos in Skypiea!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.61,0:04:26.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Luffy, that's the gorilla we\Nsaw back on the White Sea. Look!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.69,0:04:28.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What got into him?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.13,0:04:31.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's a guy running around out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.31,0:04:34.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, stop! What do you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.23,0:04:35.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To destroy you!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.05,0:04:39.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just blow us up and get it over with!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.45,0:04:44.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you don't want to die, then go\Nback to your blue sea immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.71,0:04:48.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because I promise if you do\Nanything stupid on this island,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.67,0:04:51.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we'll execute you with Enaru.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.59,0:04:56.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're up here trying\Nto kill this guy, Enel?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.17,0:04:59.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then that means that these\Ngorillas are different.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.05,0:05:03.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If different means they're not priests,\Nthen that means they don't have to kill us.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.29,0:05:07.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So for the sake of keeping all of our body\Nparts attached, can we please sail on?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.59,0:05:08.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not a chance!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.63,0:05:09.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you say to a fair fight?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.01,0:05:11.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just you and me!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.09,0:05:14.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm begging you! Please stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.83,0:05:16.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You stay on that tree ranch!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.83,0:05:18.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm coming to you! Usopp!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.35,0:05:21.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hands off!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.71,0:05:22.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Try to fight here!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.09,0:05:24.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uphold our honor! I have to!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.41,0:05:26.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,On second thought,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.95,0:05:30.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you'll probably end up\Nkilling each other before
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.55,0:05:33.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you even have a chance to\Nmake it off this island.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.51,0:05:39.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wonder why they're up here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.51,0:05:41.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.09,0:05:42.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Must be pretty serious.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.81,0:05:46.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But they seem to be enemies\Nof Enel as well as us.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.17,0:05:47.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.25,0:05:50.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I really do hate this place.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.31,0:05:51.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's keep moving.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.73,0:06:07.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll cover you!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.09,0:06:11.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get it out of that thing's mouth!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.07,0:06:14.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Move in now!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.75,0:06:58.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've been sailing forever, Sanji.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.23,0:06:59.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When can we stop?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.03,0:07:02.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can we stop now? Soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.79,0:07:04.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The sun's going down.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.27,0:07:06.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wonder what we'll run into after dark.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.87,0:07:09.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you think we can make it\Nto the altar before then?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.99,0:07:11.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, I don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.77,0:07:15.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can barely see the sunset\Nthrough those clouds.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.61,0:07:18.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm surprised they even\Nhave sunsets up here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.37,0:07:33.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can handle these guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.95,0:07:38.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, help the others! Got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.23,0:07:55.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Chopper!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.14,0:07:56.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where are you, Chopper?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.23,0:07:59.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you can hear me, answer!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.51,0:08:00.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you there?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.35,0:08:04.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look, her mast is gone and\Na wing is ripped in half.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.37,0:08:06.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's he done to her since we left?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.39,0:08:08.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Obviously, the Going Merry was attacked.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.41,0:08:10.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Chopper couldn't have done that to her.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.39,0:08:11.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Chopper!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.30,0:08:12.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry we took so long!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.25,0:08:14.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can come out now!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.43,0:08:16.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'll be safe! I promise! Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.09,0:08:19.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At least give us a sign\Nthat you're not dead!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.51,0:08:23.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So I guess that means that he's dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.11,0:08:26.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Would it kill you to think positive?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.65,0:08:28.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Chipper! Come out!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.05,0:08:31.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because Nomi's scared, and I'm tired!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.55,0:08:35.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.33,0:08:43.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everything stayed ship-shape\Nwhile you were gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.93,0:08:47.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't have to lie to\Nus, Chopper. Be strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.99,0:08:49.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tell us everything that happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.81,0:08:57.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please help me as I put a corkscrew.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.21,0:09:06.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're soaking wet.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.33,0:09:09.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Check it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.71,0:09:10.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We found it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.79,0:09:14.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's the altar with the\NGoing Mary sitting right on top!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.25,0:09:15.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.85,0:09:16.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.53,0:09:18.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mommy! Robin!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.27,0:09:20.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I missed you so much!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.59,0:09:25.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry to keep you waiting, but I\Nbeat the ordeal of love to get here!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.37,0:09:27.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I thought it was fierce, not love.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.87,0:09:30.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If that was love, I don't\Never want to find it again!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.55,0:09:31.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Anyway, who cares?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.71,0:09:32.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.91,0:09:33.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Woohoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.82,0:09:35.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sounds like they're happy to be here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.29,0:09:37.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Safe and sound.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.49,0:09:47.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where's the… mast?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.55,0:09:48.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, look.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.77,0:09:52.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I tried, but it didn't\Nmatter how hard I fought.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.37,0:09:54.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He still kept burning everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.41,0:09:57.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I promise I did everything I could. Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.29,0:09:59.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, are you going to be okay or what?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.71,0:10:06.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You must have been scared\Nfacing that guy by yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.61,0:10:10.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a good thing he set the mast\Non fire instead of you, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.79,0:10:13.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can figure out the\Ndetails on the ship later.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.87,0:10:19.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I promise to become a more\Ndependable man starting right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.91,0:10:22.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Chopper, stop yelling at the\Naltar and tell me something.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.63,0:10:24.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How'd you get rid of that priest?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.89,0:10:28.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I used the whistle the Sky Knight gave\Nus, and he showed up to rescue me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.81,0:10:29.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, where is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.05,0:10:31.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't see him.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.99,0:10:44.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's willing to sacrifice\Nthis much for us,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.87,0:10:47.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,even though he gave us\Nthat whistle for free.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.27,0:10:49.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If it wasn't for the sky night,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.89,0:10:53.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you guys probably wouldn't have\Na ship, and I'd for sure be dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.19,0:10:57.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I got a bunch of questions for him,\Nbut I guess I'll wait till he wakes up.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.69,0:10:59.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We owe you a thanks as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.21,0:11:01.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Beee!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.23,0:11:05.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.21,0:11:10.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Going Mary's trashed,\Nand it'll be dark soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.15,0:11:14.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so there's no chance we'll make it\Nback to Angel Island until tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.61,0:11:17.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We should hop over to land and\Nmake camp on shore for the night.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.95,0:11:18.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh? Why there?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.27,0:11:21.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because if we stay here\Nand someone attacks us,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.55,0:11:23.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the first thing to take a\Nbeating will be our ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.59,0:11:25.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Would you use your head, Luffy?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.71,0:11:26.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not to mention,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.62,0:11:29.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it's easier to fight from land than\Nfrom an altar floating on a cloud.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.17,0:11:36.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This isn't a party,\Nwe're in enemy territory.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.35,0:11:38.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now calm down!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.19,0:11:48.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Excellent work!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.99,0:11:52.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, based on your reports,\Nwe've learned that...
Dialogue: 1,0:11:49.12,0:11:51.96,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fs35\fnDJB CHALK IT UP\bord0\shad0\blur1\c&HD7F2D0&\frz359.7\pos(-270,1049)}The priests can predict our attacks using mantra!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.17,0:11:56.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The priests can predict our movements\Nusing a power they like to call Mantara,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.19,0:11:58.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and the bird blows flames\Nand the spear burns you?
Dialogue: 1,0:11:56.22,0:12:00.43,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fnDJB CHALK IT UP\bord0\shad0\blur1\c&HD7F2D0&\fs90\pos(810,981.8)\frz0.2\frz0.2}The part of Jaya we thought had sunk\Nwas actually {\u1\fs110}in the sky{\u0\fs90}!{\q2}
Dialogue: 1,0:11:56.22,0:12:00.43,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fnDJB CHALK IT UP\bord0\shad0\blur1\1a&HFF&\c&HD7F2D0&\fs90\pos(810,981.8)\frz0.2\frz0.2}The part of Jaya we thought had sunk\Nwas actually {\u1\1a&H00&\fs110}in the sky{\u0\1a&HFF&\fs90}!{\q2}
Dialogue: 1,0:11:56.22,0:12:01.14,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fnDJB CHALK IT UP\bord0\shad0\blur1\c&HC7D9B8&\fs90\pos(475,255)\frz0.6}The bird blows flames!{\q2}
Dialogue: 1,0:11:56.22,0:12:01.14,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fnDJB CHALK IT UP\bord0\shad0\blur1\c&HBDDEB6&\fs90\pos(1277.8,255)\frz359.9}The spear burns you!{\q2}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.45,0:12:00.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But most importantly, we've learned this!
