Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.99,0:12:04.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The City of Gold is not a thousand\Nleagues under the sea as we had thought,
Dialogue: 1,0:12:01.14,0:12:06.89,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fs32\fnDJB CHALK IT UP\bord0\shad0\blur1\c&HC7E0BA&\pos(373.6,170.6)\frz359.7}The priests can predict our attacks using mantra!
