Dialogue: 1,0:12:01.14,0:12:06.89,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fs30\fnDJB CHALK IT UP\bord0\shad0\blur1\c&HC0E3B3&\pos(498.4,325)\frz359.7}The spear burns you!
