Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.55,0:12:07.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but it is hidden somewhere\Non this very island! No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.53,0:12:10.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was the first thing I told you!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.97,0:12:13.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, what is this mantra\Nbusiness all about?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.93,0:12:17.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe it's some kind of sixth\Nsense you only get up here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.19,0:12:18.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sixth sense?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.55,0:12:21.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yo, Chopper, do I need to\Ngrind this down anymore?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.59,0:12:23.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, it needs to be a fine powder.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.83,0:12:26.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He suffered a lot of damage\Nto his digestive system.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.21,0:12:35.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is it—an adventure with\Ngold at the end. I can't wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.63,0:12:40.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,wait glad to see someone on\Nmy side I'm ready Luffy no
Dialogue: 1,0:12:39.80,0:12:44.18,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fs50\fnDJB CHALK IT UP\bord0\shad0\blur1\c&HD7F2D0&\frz359.7\pos(0,890)}The priests can predict our attacks using mantra!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.73,0:12:43.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,did you forget what the\Nscary gorilla guy said about
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.23,0:12:46.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,execution god will be really
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.67,0:12:51.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,mad sounds like fun well we
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.61,0:12:53.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,wouldn't be very good pirates\Nif we turned our backs
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.83,0:12:58.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,on gold so let's not it won't\Nbe easy you know everybody
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.23,0:13:03.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,up here already hates us\Nwhich means I'm in come on
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.11,0:13:07.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,aren't you even a little\Nfrightened of the wrath of God?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.85,0:13:10.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean, I want to live, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.85,0:13:23.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gold, and it's all waiting for us!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.81,0:13:27.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kamakiri, you gotta move!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.99,0:13:31.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks, I owe you one\Nafter that, Kamakiri.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.95,0:13:35.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kamakiri!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.93,0:13:42.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wiper!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.93,0:13:44.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kamikitty's taking a hit! Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.03,0:13:45.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.25,0:13:52.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.16,0:13:53.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So close to victory.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.63,0:13:57.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But you never even had a chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.87,0:14:01.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When night falls, we'll have\Nan even greater advantage.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.37,0:14:11.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're moving out!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.91,0:14:14.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Grab all our wounded and meet\Nback at the rendezvous point!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.63,0:14:15.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.17,0:14:19.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're not getting away!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.85,0:14:21.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Om, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.07,0:14:24.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.29,0:14:27.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have been summoned by God Enel.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.91,0:14:42.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.47,0:14:44.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah! Boring!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.39,0:14:47.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nobody told you to\Nwatch the boiling water.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.13,0:14:50.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You have one job and one job only.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.55,0:14:53.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Take the distilled water\Nand fill up the canteens.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.41,0:14:55.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, make sure that happens.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.35,0:14:57.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll need fresh drinking water tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.97,0:15:00.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmph. Whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.43,0:15:03.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sanji, we found tons of great stuff!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.59,0:15:04.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Excellent.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.50,0:15:05.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's see the hall.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.75,0:15:08.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We found walnuts, aloe, bananas, garlic...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.71,0:15:09.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Rats and frogs, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.93,0:15:11.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nice, it all goes in the pot.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.37,0:15:13.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Disgusting!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.28,0:15:15.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't expect us to\Neat that mess, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.21,0:15:16.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, silly me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.75,0:15:19.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nami, I promise I'll take the garlic out.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.73,0:15:21.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The garlic's the only good thing!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.77,0:15:24.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is our navigator having another meltdown?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.41,0:15:28.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now that's what I call a gem. It's huge!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.21,0:15:31.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Big, yes, but it's not a gemstone.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.25,0:15:34.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, that's a big salt crystal.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.27,0:15:36.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nice find, Robin, dear.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.81,0:15:38.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I found it on the shore.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.49,0:15:40.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I figured we'd find some use for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.01,0:15:45.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not only is salt vital to survival, but\Nwithout it, my food would taste awful.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.75,0:15:49.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I take half of the garlic and olive,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.47,0:15:51.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,then I can make antiseptic\Nand burn ointment?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.93,0:15:53.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and use it to heal the Second.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.79,0:15:55.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.70,0:15:56.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Need any frog?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.62,0:15:57.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, no frog.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.53,0:15:58.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Zoro, you're not doing anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.71,0:16:00.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I got a little job for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.55,0:16:07.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, Sanji, my swords weren't\Nmeant to be used like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.23,0:16:12.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but disobey the chef and you\Nprobably won't eat, so it's your call.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.11,0:16:16.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.02,0:16:18.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You just dropped a rock in the stew!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.65,0:16:19.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is it good?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.56,0:16:20.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We don't eat it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.55,0:16:21.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It helps the pot cook.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.07,0:16:25.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The stone's heat cooks the\Nstew from the inside out.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.93,0:16:27.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Trust me on this one.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.39,0:16:30.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'll need all the nutrients in\Nthis dish to survive this place.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.91,0:16:31.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Perfect, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.03,0:16:33.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Smells like we got a winner.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.45,0:16:35.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Keep your hands off.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.61,0:16:39.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sanji, I'm hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.83,0:16:41.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, it's not ready yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.53,0:16:45.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Weren't you just cramming a sky shark\Ndown your gullet not ten minutes ago?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.79,0:16:48.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but that was just an appetizer.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.59,0:16:49.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I figured you knew that.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.79,0:16:51.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You must have a rubber stomach, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.35,0:16:53.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, tell me about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.97,0:16:58.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you doing, Usopp?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.49,0:17:00.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sanji's almost got dinner laid out for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.33,0:17:03.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I figured since I wasn't\Ndoing anything anyway,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.85,0:17:06.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd start hauling this wood\Nover to the ship for repairs.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.97,0:17:08.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're going to swim over there, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.85,0:17:09.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.87,0:17:12.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So you don't have a problem\Nwith the giant sharks?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.19,0:17:18.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The ship will still be broken tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.01,0:17:20.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll fix it then.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.25,0:17:21.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's eat, Zoro!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.99,0:17:24.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What a moron.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.47,0:17:29.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, finished.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.79,0:17:32.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Soup's on, but it's ladies first, got it?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.17,0:17:33.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.08,0:17:36.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you would all please take your seats,\NI'll be around with your meals shortly.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.59,0:17:38.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And eat up, I don't want it getting cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.51,0:17:40.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, if you would all\Nlisten up while you eat,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.65,0:17:42.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll explain how we're going\Nto handle this tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.01,0:17:44.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ooh, it looks tasty.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.17,0:17:48.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Anyway, let's review Nolan's book first.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.93,0:17:52.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He discovered the city of\Ngold 400 years ago. However,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.89,0:17:55.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,after leaving the island\Nand returning with his king,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.33,0:17:57.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,he found the gold ruins had vanished.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.21,0:17:59.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Luckily, we now know what\Nhappened to these ruins.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.77,0:18:01.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Keep the ladle handy.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.35,0:18:03.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll be back for more after I...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.97,0:18:05.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sanji, pay attention!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.93,0:18:08.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was, but he was interrupting you!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.35,0:18:10.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The compliment is food and\Nthis is the thanks I get?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.03,0:18:11.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Chouchou!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.69,0:18:16.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The point I was getting at is that\Nthe gold didn't sink into the ocean,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.63,0:18:19.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but was shot up here into the\Nsky by the knock-up stream just
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.69,0:18:23.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,like we were do you really think a\Nwhole island could have done that
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.51,0:18:27.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,well it's the only thing\Nthat makes sense remember
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.49,0:18:29.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,cricket said that every\Ntime this phenomenon
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.47,0:18:32.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,occurs it's in a different\Nlocation yeah that
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.23,0:18:34.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,explosion was enormous i'm\Nnot surprised it lifted
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.69,0:18:38.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,an island it's just\Nhard to believe that the
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.43,0:18:40.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,forest we're sitting in is\Nthe same one we saw back
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.87,0:18:43.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,on jaya i believe that\Nhas something to do with
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.03,0:18:46.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the odd composition of\Nthe island clouds up here.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.69,0:18:49.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look at all the trees, fish, and wildlife.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.25,0:18:52.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Something about this environment\Ndramatically increases growth rates,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.59,0:18:54.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,which explains how a\Nsociety here could have
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.75,0:18:56.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,been swallowed up by\Nthese burgeoning forces.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.73,0:19:00.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That also explains why the south\Nbirds who saved us were so huge.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.55,0:19:01.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I couldn't believe it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.01,0:19:05.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, 400 years of growing\Nwill do that to a bird.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.31,0:19:06.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then why, here,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.11,0:19:09.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,why did those south birds\Ngo to such great lengths to
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.51,0:19:15.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,save you, guys. Um, I don't\Nknow, but when they saw him they
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.43,0:19:20.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,referred to the sky knight\Nas god he's god so if We beat
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.19,0:19:22.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the crud out of this guy\Nthat our job here is done no
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.73,0:19:25.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,genius how'd you get that\Nout Of what he's saying would
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.15,0:19:28.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,both of you loud mouths just\Npipe down yeah shut up yeah
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.77,0:19:33.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,wait who's a Loud mouth you\Nare you both are can it now
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.17,0:19:36.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,does anyone recall what\Nnolan's log said about the city
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.49,0:19:37.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I do!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.41,0:19:38.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a city of gold!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.89,0:19:39.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're such a dumbass!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.01,0:19:41.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you ever think before you talk?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.73,0:19:45.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think he wrote about south\Nbirds and a giant gold bell.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.43,0:19:47.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Course, there could be a lot more.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.59,0:19:51.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The last thing he wrote in the log\Nbefore he died was something odd.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.53,0:19:54.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's something I can't figure out,\Neven after seeing this island.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.97,0:19:57.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It says the city of gold\Nis in a skull's right eye.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.51,0:19:59.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's it. Check it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.09,0:20:02.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I matched up Robin's\Nmap of Jaya with the old
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.79,0:20:04.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Skypiea map that we\Nfound in the shipwreck.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.03,0:20:08.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course, this isn't exact and\Nthere may be some incorrect overlap?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.95,0:20:10.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But when you match up\Nthe location of Cricket's
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.99,0:20:13.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,house With the broken\Npart we found up here,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.57,0:20:16.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,this is what Jaya looked\Nlike 400 years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.43,0:20:18.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Neat! It's a skull!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.03,0:20:20.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It is a skull!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.93,0:20:22.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.77,0:20:25.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Way to go, Nami!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.83,0:20:27.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.39,0:20:30.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, but where in the skull's right eye?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.85,0:20:33.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm, I'm thinking right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.83,0:20:37.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's the one structure that's\Nactually inside the eye.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.45,0:20:40.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And no one's found it yet because\Nof all the people who've tried,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.07,0:20:43.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we're the ones who had both maps.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.51,0:20:44.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.89,0:20:46.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We must be lucky pirates.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.17,0:20:48.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That kind of makes sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.87,0:20:49.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hidden treasure!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.55,0:20:51.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Treasure!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.81,0:20:55.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The only thing left to do is\Nmake our way to the skull's eye.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.31,0:20:57.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But since we can't leave\Nthe ship unguarded,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.63,0:21:00.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,tomorrow morning we'll split\Nthe crew into two teams.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.39,0:21:02.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is our time.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.11,0:21:07.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,On the other side of this island waits\Nmore gold than we've ever dreamed.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.09,0:21:10.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now that's what I call gourmet.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.17,0:21:12.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tomorrow we get the gold.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.67,0:21:13.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.77,0:21:16.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You think it'll be sunny again?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.79,0:21:18.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're above the clouds, so I guess yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.91,0:21:20.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's put out the fires\Nif we don't need them.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.05,0:21:23.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's beginning to get late, you guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.25,0:21:26.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We don't want to announce\Nour location to our enemies.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.61,0:21:28.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What a rookie move.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.35,0:21:29.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You hear that, Usopp?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.77,0:21:31.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She wants us to douse the fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.43,0:21:32.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are we gonna do?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.34,0:21:38.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh. I don't know. It's not really her\Nfault, though she's never been exposed to.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.33,0:21:43.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,this kind of living before we should\Nbe tolerant huh what are you two saying
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.19,0:21:50.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you're always supposed to have a campfire\Nwhen you camp that's what makes it camping
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.71,0:21:59.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it's never ending with those\Nidiots hey lay off the sob
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.27,0:22:01.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stories, you know how\Ndangerous this island can be.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.07,0:22:03.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,let's not give it any help in killing us.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.03,0:22:04.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't care!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.94,0:22:05.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're in the middle of a war.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.01,0:22:07.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Between priests protecting their god?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.83,0:22:09.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and gorillas forging a coup.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.49,0:22:11.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not to mention the giant\Nbloodthirsty monsters
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.61,0:22:13.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that wait around every corner to eat us.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.91,0:22:14.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No monsters!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.51,0:22:17.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sky Island scary, Sky Island scary.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.91,0:22:19.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Luffy, take a look.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.73,0:22:21.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is this enough wood for your fire?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.95,0:22:24.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can you idiots think for one second?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.13,0:22:27.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, wild animals\Nare afraid of fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.27,0:22:29.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They'll stay away.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.43,0:22:32.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But they're surrounding us!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.21,0:22:34.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have to run or we'll die!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.49,0:22:43.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Chopper, I think it's trying to talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.31,0:22:44.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You mind translating?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.11,0:22:54.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's the festival on the\Nnight before gold party! Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.37,0:23:00.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is fantastic!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.03,0:23:03.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And you guys really make this stuff?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.15,0:23:03.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's great!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.13,0:23:04.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,More, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.29,0:23:22.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tomorrow the treasure's on!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.63,0:23:31.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm surprised you're getting along\Nso well with the Cloud Wolves.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.03,0:23:36.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know of no one else who could have\Nsuch raucous festivities on Eneru's land.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.67,0:23:39.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's good to see that you're away.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.59,0:23:40.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you feeling any better?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.83,0:23:43.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I apologize for being\Nsuch a burden to you all.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.63,0:23:46.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, you're too hard on yourself, old man.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.35,0:23:50.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You saved Chopper, and you kept our ship\Nfrom being blown to a thousand pieces.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.65,0:23:51.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's my duty.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.56,0:23:53.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's plenty of stew left.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.33,0:23:54.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Would you like some?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.25,0:23:55.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.16,0:23:56.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, not right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.51,0:24:00.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.42,0:24:03.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks for everything,\NSecond! Let's dance!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.49,0:24:05.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dance with the skybox!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.91,0:24:07.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Chopper, you been drinking?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.71,0:24:10.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, old man, I got a question.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.03,0:24:12.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Conis, is she okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.51,0:24:13.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Very much so.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.75,0:24:16.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've sheltered her and\Nher father at my house.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.17,0:24:17.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're fine. Great.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.69,0:24:19.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was worried she'd never see me again.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.91,0:24:22.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm so happy that both of them are safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.91,0:24:25.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, let's celebrate by tossing chopper.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.45,0:24:42.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry for eavesdropping,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.29,0:24:44.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but I heard your earlier\Nconversation about how
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.47,0:24:47.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,this island was known\Nlong ago by the name Jaya.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.51,0:24:48.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.55,0:24:53.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but I believe you have yet to hear the\Nstory of how this island on which we sit
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.55,0:24:56.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,came to be known as such holy ground.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.99,0:25:07.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is this what was so distracting\Nfor you in battle, Lucky?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.15,0:25:08.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you here to sabotage us?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.89,0:25:10.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get in our way and slow us down?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.01,0:25:12.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, I'm not.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.49,0:25:14.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I feel awful for Kamakiri.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.19,0:25:16.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We were fighting the priests.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.95,0:25:19.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can't afford to be off-task at all\Nif we want to make it to God's shrine.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.01,0:25:22.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Apologizing won't fix\Nanything, I know that.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.29,0:25:23.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So give that back to me now.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.03,0:25:26.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It belongs to Aisa. It's hers.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.61,0:25:28.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I promised I would bring\Nback some birth for her.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.87,0:25:30.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Give it back to me, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.27,0:25:31.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.18,0:25:32.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You have to let me have it.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.77,0:25:38.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kamakiri, you shouldn't\Neven be standing right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.97,0:25:40.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can still fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.11,0:25:48.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're right—this is our best\Ntime to strike the Upper Yard.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.19,0:25:56.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,With Satori gone, we proved today that\Nwe can defeat the remaining priests.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.63,0:25:59.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I say we attack again\Ntomorrow at first light.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.61,0:26:12.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The ground of the upper yard must remind\Nyou blue sea people of your home far below.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.35,0:26:19.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It is similar right it\Nis yes you're lucky what
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.25,0:26:21.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you see all around us\Nand beneath our feet is.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.81,0:26:23.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Something that does not\Nnaturally exist in the
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.73,0:26:27.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,sky island cloud can\Nsupport plant life but it.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.65,0:26:29.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It cannot generate its own.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.45,0:26:32.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Greenery and soil are both\Nforeign things to our life here.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.25,0:26:43.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Our people have our own\Nname for this, its birth.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.71,0:26:48.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those living among the\Nclouds hold this sacred.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.01,0:26:50.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's what they all desire.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.85,0:26:55.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Once we defeat Enel,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.85,0:27:00.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There will be no need for you to sneak\Naround obsessing over a single bag of Fourth.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.97,0:27:02.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The time is now.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.09,0:27:12.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We will return after 400 years of exile\Nto the true home of the Shandians.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.29,0:27:14.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Aw, come on, Zoro.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.61,0:27:15.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Be a pal.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.45,0:27:17.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Forget it.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.36,0:27:18.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not going with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.67,0:27:23.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you're scared, just hold it till\Nmorning and quit whining, you big baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.41,0:27:28.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I would if I could! Believe me,\Njust go take a leak by yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.55,0:27:29.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's cold Zoro.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.17,0:27:31.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's really cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.77,0:27:52.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What was that noise?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.41,0:28:06.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There shouldn't be anyone\Non the ship at this hour.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.23,0:28:11.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Geez, this fog is so thick,\NI can't see who it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.59,0:28:16.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shhh!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.61,0:28:29.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shhh! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.05,0:28:33.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.21,0:28:48.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's your problem, you moron?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.95,0:28:51.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did you fall asleep mid-piss?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.35,0:28:52.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's pathetic.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.41,0:28:56.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.32,0:28:57.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.24,0:28:58.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,saw...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.15,0:29:01.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Usopp, would you snap out of it?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.47,0:29:02.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I saw...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.87,0:29:04.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,a ghost...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.41,0:29:05.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,a ghost...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.63,0:29:06.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,a ghost!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:10.73,0:29:12.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why are we...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.39,0:29:13.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh
Dialogue: 0,0:29:16.19,0:29:17.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey.
Dialogue: 2,0:29:19.05,0:29:23.18,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,0)\an2\fnFOT-Greco Std DB Strp\bord0\fsp0\fscx80\fscy80\c&HFFFFFF&\blur0.8\an5\pos(699,800)}God's Shrine
Dialogue: 1,0:29:19.05,0:29:23.18,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,0)\an2\fnFOT-Greco Std DB Strp\bord2.5\fsp0\fscx80\fscy80\c&H000000&\blur0.8\an5\pos(699,800)}God's Shrine
Dialogue: 0,0:29:24.23,0:29:26.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you're gonna say something spit it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.53,0:29:29.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't just stand there chewing on your lip
Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.09,0:29:34.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.71,0:29:38.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We all know why we're here\Nbecause you let wiper get
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.93,0:29:41.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,away instead of killing him\Nwhen you had the chance!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.09,0:29:44.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now God Enel will punish\Nus all for your failure.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.03,0:29:51.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You think you're pretty hot stuff\Nsince you got lucky and beat that fool,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.13,0:29:52.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Godfall, don't you, Shit?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:53.15,0:29:53.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Amusing.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.13,0:30:02.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your Majesty, your priests have arrived.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:03.37,0:30:04.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Open the gate.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.03,0:30:18.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not again! What are you doing this?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.45,0:30:22.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,is disgraceful you should be ashamed.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.81,0:30:26.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shut up these two have\Nheld me back far too long
Dialogue: 0,0:30:26.93,0:30:30.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,just let me unleash my\Nfull power i could take
Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.53,0:30:32.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,care of this whole island\Nmyself if it weren't
Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.85,0:30:35.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,for these two bunglers\Nalways getting in my way?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:36.11,0:30:38.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh, that's some big talk, Shudder.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:38.63,0:30:42.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe it's time for me to teach you\Nwhat the true meaning of power is,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.51,0:30:44.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,if you think you've got the guts.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.65,0:30:53.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's see if you can\Nhandle the ordeal of iron.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.75,0:30:57.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your ordeal of iron couldn't even\Ntest the strength of a child.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.49,0:31:02.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My ordeal of swamp is\Nthe ultimate challenge.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:02.67,0:31:04.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Try that if you're not too afraid.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:05.65,0:31:08.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My Lord Kitetsu, that\Nlooks extremely tiring.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:08.83,0:31:10.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you want to cross your arms,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.11,0:31:12.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you need to hold them like this\Nand rest them on your chest.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:13.05,0:31:13.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:14.67,0:31:15.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:15.65,0:31:16.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cease this chatter!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.15,0:31:19.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're standing in the\Npresence of God himself!
Dialogue: 2,0:31:17.33,0:31:19.96,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(317,0)\an2\fnFOT-Greco Std DB Strp\bord0\fsp2\fscx90\fscy90\c&HFFFFFF&\blur0.8\an5\pos(730,660)}Yama\NSkypiean Abbot
Dialogue: 1,0:31:17.33,0:31:19.96,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(317,0)\an2\fnFOT-Greco Std DB Strp\bord2.5\fsp2\fscx90\fscy90\c&H000000&\1a&HFF&\blur0.8\an5\t(275,317,\1a&H00&)\pos(730,660)}Yama\NSkypiean Abbot
Dialogue: 0,0:31:20.73,0:31:21.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:21.64,0:31:22.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I see an empty chair.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:23.15,0:31:25.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't see anyone sitting in it.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.83,0:31:27.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Surprise, boys!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:45.79,0:31:47.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You asked?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.35,0:31:48.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here I am.
Dialogue: 2,0:31:47.70,0:31:55.20,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(602,401)\an2\fnFOT-Greco Std DB Strp\bord0\fsp2\fscx90\fscy90\c&HFFFFFF&\blur0.8\an5\pos(730,660)}Skypiea's One and Only\NGod Enel
Dialogue: 1,0:31:47.70,0:31:55.20,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(602,401)\an2\fnFOT-Greco Std DB Strp\bord2.5\fsp2\fscx90\fscy90\c&H000000&\1a&HFF&\blur0.8\an5\t(561,602,\1a&H00&)\t(7109,7151,\1a&HFF&)\pos(730,660)}Skypiea's One and Only\NGod Enel
Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.75,0:31:50.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You boys are getting slow.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:50.49,0:31:51.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're out of practice.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.81,0:31:54.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If that pathetic display\Nis any indication,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.49,0:31:58.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you're all well on your way\Ntowards ending up dismal failures
Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.35,0:31:59.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,like Satori.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:59.55,0:32:01.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is the meaning of this?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:01.45,0:32:04.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why, God, why do you mock us?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:04.13,0:32:07.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that the reason you summoned\Nus here to entertain yourself?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:07.91,0:32:09.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was bored.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:11.17,0:32:12.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now have a seat.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.25,0:32:16.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't seem to have given too much\Nthought to the Blue Sea-Dwellers yet,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:16.97,0:32:17.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,have you?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.11,0:32:21.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,God, Inaru, if this is\Nabout Sartori's failure...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:21.33,0:32:23.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That idiot was too inexperienced.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:23.63,0:32:26.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And that ridiculous ordeal of spheres. Ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:27.73,0:32:30.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're hardly in a\Nposition to talk, Shura.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:32.99,0:32:34.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why they're looking for gold?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.05,0:32:36.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's obvious.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.87,0:32:38.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What? Gold?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:39.41,0:32:40.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Impossible How...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.95,0:32:42.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,how did they know?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.71,0:32:45.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This island was originally\Npart of the Blue Sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:45.59,0:32:48.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not so odd that they\Nshould know about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:52.45,0:32:54.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course, they'll move tomorrow!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:54.63,0:32:56.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As will the Shandians.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:58.09,0:33:01.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The rules state that each of you\Nrun an area of the upper yard.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:01.45,0:33:03.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And you're not allowed\Nto enter each other's
Dialogue: 0,0:33:03.55,0:33:06.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,areas or interfere with\None another in any way.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:07.01,0:33:09.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tomorrow, I'll allow you\Nto go where you will.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:10.19,0:33:13.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You may set up your\Nordeals wherever you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:14.07,0:33:15.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There will be no restrictions.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:15.77,0:33:18.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get as vicious as you like.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:18.73,0:33:21.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why are you being so\Ngenerous all of a sudden?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:21.61,0:33:26.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because my friends i'm pleased to announce\Nthat the maxim is almost complete.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:26.69,0:33:29.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So it's time for us to put an\Nend to this wretched island!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:29.89,0:33:33.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and set forth on our journey\Nto the world of dreams.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:36.31,0:33:37.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's true!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:37.45,0:33:38.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wasn't dreaming!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:38.57,0:33:40.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Someone was here last night!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:41.03,0:33:42.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Going Mary!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:42.63,0:33:43.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's been repaired!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:45.79,0:33:46.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I knew it!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:47.97,0:33:50.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,See, guys, I told you I wasn't insane!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:53.27,0:33:54.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't believe it.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:55.01,0:33:56.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The mast is fixed.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:56.69,0:33:58.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, now that's service.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:59.09,0:34:02.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hate to say it, but\Nthey did a lousy job.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:02.47,0:34:04.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, whoever did it sure is nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:04.73,0:34:07.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But who'd risk crossing a\Nriver full of sky sharks
Dialogue: 0,0:34:07.35,0:34:09.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,to come all the way out here\Nand fix our ship for us?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:10.05,0:34:11.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean, as far as we can tell,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:12.13,0:34:15.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the only people here on Upper\NYard are us and our enemies.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:15.67,0:34:19.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, did you notice they took\Nall the flying gear off the ship?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:19.39,0:34:20.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:22.49,0:34:26.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've been thinking about it, and\Nit's really got me wondering.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:29.37,0:34:30.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:30.31,0:34:32.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It just doesn't make any sense to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:32.47,0:34:36.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How could this phantom repairman know\Nwhat the Mary's supposed to look like?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:36.57,0:34:40.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How did he know she didn't always\Nhave a comb or wings or a tail?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:42.67,0:34:43.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:43.58,0:34:45.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How could he possibly have known?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:51.39,0:34:52.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, Mary.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:52.59,0:34:54.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just tell me who I saw.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:00.11,0:35:01.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, let's look at the map.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:02.15,0:35:05.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The exploration team will be\Ntaking this route, moving south.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:06.39,0:35:09.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There should be some old ruins\Nnear the Skull's right eye.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:09.59,0:35:12.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Keep an eye out for enemies\Nand bring back that gold.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:12.69,0:35:14.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh, you make it sound so easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:14.91,0:35:17.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hold on, you're the one who keeps\Ntalking about gold and more gold,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:17.93,0:35:18.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but you're not coming?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:18.85,0:35:21.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, of course not, it's way too scary.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:21.25,0:35:24.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She wants the gold, but she doesn't\Nwant to risk anything to get it?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:24.71,0:35:26.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's just too weird!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:26.69,0:35:29.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll be in danger too\Nyou know we'll be taking
Dialogue: 0,0:35:29.59,0:35:33.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the mary down river through\Nthe island then we'll
Dialogue: 0,0:35:33.61,0:35:36.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,head for the beach near\Nthe ruins we can meet up
Dialogue: 0,0:35:36.43,0:35:39.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,here and then we can escape\Nthis stupid sky island?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:40.53,0:35:44.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At long last we'll be a rich and\Npowerful pirate crew able to buy
Dialogue: 0,0:35:44.49,0:35:50.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,anything oh yeah all the meat i\Ncan eat escape that sounds great
Dialogue: 0,0:35:50.79,0:35:57.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,look the weather's perfect sure\Nwe're on top of the clouds okay
Dialogue: 0,0:35:57.17,0:36:01.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we'll all meet safely on the east\Ncoast you bet let's get going then!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:33.33,0:36:36.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who will fall before my ordeal of string?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:36.79,0:36:40.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Shandians or the Blue Sea people?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:46.23,0:36:49.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And so the festival begins, magnificent.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:50.37,0:36:52.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Today will be a great day.

